{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he said</b> — <b>Go, Daniel</b>: As if saying to him, go your way and do not ask further, for the matters are sealed and closed. And this is a sign that at the time of the end the discerning will understand the angel's hints; therefore after it they will be refined and whitened, a parable of the nations to souls that will grow wise and accept the truth."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:27.575176510Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}